Paint X is an easy to get fun and rich hand drawn drawing software. In addition to drawing, it can also be used for coloring, sketching, and graffiti. A colorful brush, fun and practical.

-Supports image color picking, allowing you to find the color you want in just one second;

-Multiple brushes available for more convenient and convenient use;

-Support free color filling, color selection, and easier color filling and painting;

-Line copying and painting, even beginners can quickly get started;

-Rich material templates, the next master painter is you!

